-- F-2023-24_tashpad_02-j: the same principal's A carries the erosion
-- supplement and her B does not.
`the principal's A is eroded and her B is not` MEANS
        `truncated to the agora` (`a manager's salary for conversion` `the principal example's components by position` 6104.14 1.4 TIMES 1.034) EQUALS 17117.71
    AND `rounded to the agora` (17117.71 TIMES 1.15) EQUALS `the principal example's A as printed`
    AND `the personal supplement` 20735.13 15 20086.68 EQUALS `the principal example's personal supplement as printed`
    AND NOT (`rounded to the agora` (20735.13 TIMES 1.15 TIMES 1.034) MINUS 20086.68 EQUALS `the principal example's personal supplement as printed`)
#ASSERT `the principal's A is eroded and her B is not`

§§ `נספח ה' — כתובות לפניות`

-- akn:att_5__hc_1 Annex ה, the addresses for enquiries (teachers' data, online files, the service centre, the Ofek call centre, promotions, commitment letters, employment approvals, the profile); no rule.

-- Examples of who joins. The teachers are made up.
GIVEN `academic` IS A BOOLEAN, `certified` IS A BOOLEAN, `prior years` IS A NUMBER, `seniority` IS A NUMBER, `position` IS A NUMBER, `age` IS A NUMBER, `health` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `tashpad 2 teacher`
DECIDE `a teacher with` `academic` `certified` `prior years` `seniority` `position` `age` `health` IS
    `tashpad 2 teacher` WITH
        `teacher role`                    IS `teacher`
        `academic`                        IS `academic`
        `certified to teach`              IS `certified`
        `prior teaching years recognized` IS `prior years`
        `teaching seniority`              IS `seniority`
        `position fraction`               IS `position`
        `is an intern`                    IS FALSE
        `approved as an exception`        IS FALSE
        `of the health professions`       IS `health`
        `age`                             IS `age`

`a special-education school` MEANS `tashpad 2 school` WITH
    `recognized unofficial special education` IS TRUE
    `already in Ofek Hadash`                  IS FALSE

#ASSERT `joins Ofek Hadash from תשפ"ד` `a special-education school`
#ASSERT `joins Ofek Hadash` (`a teacher with` TRUE TRUE 10 10 0.5 40 FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT `joins Ofek Hadash` (`a teacher with` TRUE TRUE 10 10 0.25 40 FALSE)
#ASSERT `joins Ofek Hadash` (`a teacher with` FALSE TRUE 30 30 1 58 FALSE)
#ASSERT `the minimum position` (`a teacher with` TRUE TRUE 5 5 0.2 40 TRUE) FALSE EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `the week of` `post-primary special-education school` TRUE EQUALS `the post-primary health-professions week`
#ASSERT `the week of` `multi-stage, grades 1-6` FALSE EQUALS `the primary special-education week`
#ASSERT `the position of single frontal hours` 3 26 EQUALS 3 DIVIDED BY 26
#ASSERT `the complexity level of a special-education school` 1 EQUALS 3
#ASSERT `the age hours of` (`a teacher with` TRUE TRUE 20 20 1 56 FALSE) EQUALS `age hours` 3 1 32
#ASSERT `the Ofek Hadash advance` `teacher` TRUE `post-primary, or grades 7 and up of a multi-stage school` (`advance components` 10000 0 0 0 0 0 0 0 0) 0.5 EQUALS 1000
#ASSERT `the deputy's bonus` 5000 EQUALS 1100
#ASSERT `who determines` `setting the Ofek Hadash grade` EQUALS `the Ministry of Education`

#TRACE `the commitment letter` `a special-education school` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the local authority or owning body` DOES `submit the commitment letter` AT 14
#TRACE `the commitment letter` `a special-education school` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the local authority or owning body` DOES `submit the commitment letter` AT 15
